      "method": "Three OpenStreetMap campus polygons combined into one MultiPolygon, used verbatim: way 28028409 and way 26680824 (both named 'Paul Scherrer Institut', research_institute, on the Villigen/west bank -- corroborated by the separately-fetched named locality node 'PSI West' at 47.5368N, 8.2222E, which falls inside way 28028409's own bounding box) and way 26680821 (same name, on the Wurenlingen/east bank, corroborated by locality node 'PSI Ost' at 47.5386N, 8.2300E). The two-bank split matches PSI's own official description: 'located in the Canton of Aargau in the municipalities Villigen and Wurenlingen on either side of the River Aare.' Fetched through Nominatim's polygon_geojson=1 output rather than a direct Overpass extract (Overpass was unreachable this session), but the geometry is the same underlying OSM way data.",
      "name": "PSI Villigen/Wurenlingen campus boundary",
