    "summary": {
      "plain": "The Paul Scherrer Institute's two-bank campus beside the River Aare in Aargau, Switzerland, drawn to scale from OpenStreetMap as a campus boundary; the HIPA ring cyclotron and its experimental halls could not be located to scale this session because OpenStreetMap's Overpass query service was unreachable throughout."
